### 2. Fix RAG Copilot Client (`backend/rag/copilot.py`)
Currently, this file has `max_tokens=1024` and its own flawed copy of `get_groq_client()`.
- Remove the local `get_groq_client()` implementation.
- Import the new `execute_with_fallback()` function from `backend.ai.llm_client`.
- Replace the direct `groq_client.chat.completions.create` call with the wrapper function.
- Decrease `max_tokens` from 1024 to 800.

